# WordFlow AI Design Rule

When editing **UI** in `poly_apps/wordflow-ai` (React/TSX, CSS, HTML):

1. **Design Tokens.** All visual tokens in `index.css` (`:root` / `html.dark`) and `StyleCenter.ts`. **Mobile/adaptive:** `--touch-min` (44px), `--grid-unit` (8px), `--page-padding-h/v`, `--bar-gap`; use `env(safe-area-inset-*)` in layout. Glass/material/motion: `--glass-opacity`, `--glass-blur`, `--border-highlight`; `--material-thin-*`, `--material-thick-*`; `--ease-spring`, `--ease-liquid`, `--ease-smooth`; `--radius-card`, `--radius-button`; `--shadow-*`; bar/bento/fluid tokens.

2. **Base > Personalized (基类 > 个性化).** 主题、组件、样式均先应用设计系统基类，再扩展个性化类。Base: **`ds-material-thin`**, **`ds-material-thick`**, `ds-card`, `ds-glass`, `ds-glass-edge`, `ds-row`, `ds-empty`, `ds-btn`, **`ds-btn-pill`**, **`ds-btn-bento`**, **`ds-btn-fluid`**, `ds-section-label`, `ds-modal-backdrop`, `ds-modal-panel`, **`ds-bar-pill`**, **`ds-bar-tab`**, **`ds-page`** (自适应宽度), **`ds-page-contained`**, **`ds-stack`**, **`ds-stack-tight`**, **`ds-grid-breathing`**, **`ds-touch-target`**, `ds-aura-bg`, `ds-aura-overlay`. **全局顶栏：** 非 auth/非沉浸页由 **AppLayout** 统一提供 **TopBar**（搜索胶囊 + **ThemeToggle** + **LanguageDropdown** + 设置 + 头像）；Auth 页使用 **AuthLayout** 内 **TopBar variant="minimal"**（仅主题 + 语言）。组件中心化：**ThemeToggle**、**LanguageDropdown**、**TopBar**、**SearchOverlay**、**AppLayout** 为抽象组件，样式遵循 ds-* 基类。

3. **Glassmorphism.** Semi-transparent surfaces use `ds-glass` (backdrop-blur `--glass-blur` 30–50px, `--glass-opacity`, 1px `--border-highlight` edge lighting). Add `ds-glass-edge` for inner glow. Material presets: `ds-material-thin` (极薄玻璃), `ds-material-thick` (厚重磨砂). Layer depth: `ds-glass-sm` / `ds-glass-md` / `ds-glass-lg`.

4. **Background.** Page background uses `ds-aura-bg` + `ds-aura-overlay` (mesh/aura: cyan, purple, blue fluid). Keep page wrapper `bg-transparent` so aura shows; do not replace with solid fills unless required.

5. **Cards & Rows.** Cards: `ds-card`. List rows: `ds-row`. Empty: `ds-empty`. Modal: `ds-modal-backdrop` + `ds-modal-panel`. **Layout:** `ds-page` 自适应全宽+安全区；`ds-page-contained` 可选；`ds-stack`, `ds-stack-tight`, `ds-grid-breathing`；可点击 ≥ `ds-touch-target` / `--touch-min`。**顶栏：** 每页由 AppLayout 提供 TopBar（搜索+主题+语言+设置+头像）；Auth 页 AuthLayout 提供 TopBar minimal；抽象组件 ThemeToggle、LanguageDropdown、TopBar、SearchOverlay、AppLayout 中心化，基类 ds-*。

6. **Pill/CTA Button.** Primary CTA (e.g. login/register submit): use `Button variant="pill" showSparkles`. Styles from `ds-btn-pill`: full stadium (rounded-full), purple gradient (`--cta-gradient-from/to`), inner glow bottom (`--cta-inner-glow-bottom`), 0.5–1pt glass border (`--cta-border-stroke`), colored drop shadow (`--cta-shadow-colored`), inset top/bottom for 3D relief. Background behind CTA: backdrop blur 12–20px (`ds-glass`).

7. **Bento / Neo-Brutalism Button.** Modular high-contrast CTA: `Button variant="bento"`. Left accent block uses `--bento-lime` (fluorescent lime), right label area `--bento-deep` (deep gray), border `--bento-border`, shadow `--shadow-deep`. Use `IconsDotMatrix.ArrowRight` in accent. Compact: add class `ds-btn-bento-compact` for section links.

8. **Fluid / Vibrant Fluidity Button.** Gradient + motion feel: `Button variant="fluid" showPlay`. Tokens: `--fluid-from/mid/to` (cyan–purple–green), `--fluid-glow`; subtle background-position animation and hover shine. Use for “Play” / “Start” / “Create” CTAs.

9. **Components.** `components/UI.tsx` Card uses `ds-card`; Button variants: `primary`, `pill`, **`bento`**, **`fluid`**, `secondary`, `outline`, `danger`, `ghost`. Style governance: `--primary-blur`, `--shadow-deep`; icons use atomic grid (e.g. `IconsDotMatrix`). StyleCenter.ts references tokens; do not bypass for one-off inline styles.

10. **Bottom bar.** `ds-bar-pill` 自适应宽度（left/right 用 `--bar-gap` 与 safe-area）；`ds-bar-tab` 含 `min-width/min-height: var(--touch-min)`。Animation: `--ease-spring` / `--ease-liquid`.

**AI prompts:** Hyper-realistic Glassmorphism, Aurora mesh gradients, Liquid morphing, Spring-based physics. **Centralized:** global token + material presets + single motion curve. **Mobile:** adaptive layout (no fixed width), safe area, touch targets ≥44px, base > personalized for theme/components/styles.

Canonical: `poly_apps/wordflow-ai/index.css`, `poly_apps/wordflow-ai/styles/StyleCenter.ts`. Full design language: skill **wordflow-design-system**.
